<title>LITHUANIA: SOCCER-LITHUANIA BEAT ICELAND 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LITHUANIA BEAT ICELAND 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania beat Iceland 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup group eight qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Socers: Edgars Jankauskas (penalty, 22nd), Vaidotas Shlekys (73rd)</p>
<p>Attendance 4,000  </p>
<p>Group eight standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Macedonia	 2   1   1   0   4   1    4</p>
<p> Ireland	   1   1   0   0   5   0    3</p>
<p> Romania	   1   1   0   0   3   0    3</p>
<p> Lithuania	 2   1   0   1   2   3    3</p>
<p> Iceland	   2   0   1   1   1   3    1</p>
<p> Liechtenstein   2   0   0   2   0   8    0</p>
</text>
